#: ../../guide-config-language.md:1
msgid "Adding Language Support via Config (No Code Required)"
msgstr "Adding Language Support via Config (No Code Required)"

#: ../../guide-config-language.md:3
msgid "lang-check supports two no-code ways to recognize additional file formats:"
msgstr "lang-check supports two no-code ways to recognize additional file formats:"

#: ../../guide-config-language.md:5
msgid "map a new extension onto an existing built-in language, or"
msgstr "map a new extension onto an existing built-in language, or"

#: ../../guide-config-language.md:6
msgid "define a **Simplified Language Schema (SLS)** in YAML for a format that does not have a built-in tree-sitter extractor."
msgstr "define a **Simplified Language Schema (SLS)** in YAML for a format that does not have a built-in tree-sitter extractor."

#: ../../guide-config-language.md:9
msgid "This page focuses on the SLS workflow."
msgstr "This page focuses on the SLS workflow."

#: ../../guide-config-language.md:11
